error: invalid package artifact source
 | 
 | foo:::/absolute/path
 | ~~~~~^ expected a URL or a relative path without separators or a NUL byte.
 | 
 = while parsing:
   package artifact source: (foo:::/absolute/path)
   → expected a URL or a relative path without separators or a NUL byte.
 = an error occurred: The path is not a relative sibling file, i.e. it either starts with a `./` or contains a directory: :/absolute/path
